# Every fixture here is its own tiny, workspace-isolated crate (see any
# `*/Cargo.toml` for why) built on demand by `tests/support/mod.rs`. Its
# build output and lockfile are exactly as disposable as the main
# workspace's own `/target` and root `Cargo.lock` — regenerated by the next
# `cargo test` run, never something to commit.
*/target/
*/Cargo.lock
